.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.eggs/
memory/*.md
memory/*.json
# Operational-log exhaust (2026-08-26, ported from galadriel private harness):
# NOT curated memory — raw per-turn telemetry (tool-cascade traces, full
# cached-prefix dumps, the append-only conversation journal). mempalace
# mines by extension (.jsonl is READABLE); without these excludes a
# full-repo mine sweeps them in as if each line were a hand-filed drawer.
# Found on the private box 2026-08-26: 181,212 of 206,387 drawers (~88%)
# were exactly this. The journal has its own dedicated lexical-fallback
# recall path — it does not need, and must never get, vector embedding.
memory/prompt_trace/
memory/cascades/
memory/fresh_narrative_shadow/
memory/journal/
!memory/.gitkeep
*.log
.venv/
venv/
# Debug prompt dumps contain full system prompt content
debug/prompts/
